## Documentation Requirements

### Copy-Paste Commands

All commands MUST be copy-pasteable. Include full context:

```markdown
## Quick Start

```bash
# Install suparship
curl -sSL https://get.suparship.io | bash

# Create a local demo environment
suparship demo

# Open ArgoCD dashboard
suparship open argocd
```

After running these commands, you'll have:
- A local k3d cluster named `suparship`
- ArgoCD at https://argocd.localhost
- Kargo at https://kargo.localhost
- Sample app at https://sample.dev.localhost
```

