## Error Messages as Documentation

Error messages SHOULD be self-documenting:

```go
// BAD
return errors.New("invalid profile")

// GOOD
return fmt.Errorf("invalid profile %q: must be one of: demo, core, full", profile)

// BETTER
return fmt.Errorf(`invalid profile %q

Available profiles:
  demo    Local development with sample app
  core    Minimal GitOps (ArgoCD + Kargo)
  full    Complete stack with monitoring

Example: suparship install --profile=core`, profile)
```
